  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Arcane Fusion, Knowledge of at least one technique</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When you perform a technique that uses talents from multiple different casting traditions you possess, you may use the Arcane Fusion feat as if you could create the effect with each casting tradition used. For each casting tradition beyond the first used with Arcane Fusion, you are considered to have paid for 1 point of the technique’s complexity cost.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
